---
interface Props {
  subscriptionUrl: string;
}

const { subscriptionUrl } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section final-cta" id="empieza" aria-labelledby="final-title" data-track-section="final_cta">
  <div class="final-compass" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none">
      <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="188" stroke="currentColor"></circle>
      <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="132" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".55"></circle>
      <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="72" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".35"></circle>
      <path d="m238 110-23 106-53 74 23-106 53-74Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="10" fill="#2e3b70"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container final-inner">
    <span class="section-kicker">El siguiente paso</span>
    <h2 id="final-title">Tu próxima misión te está esperando</h2>
    <p>No necesitas tener toda la vida resuelta. Solo una frase honesta y diez segundos para ver el primer camino.</p>
    <a class="button button--light" href="#prueba-tu-mision" data-focus-demo data-track="mission_cta_clicked" data-track-location="final_cta">
      Escribe tu misión
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
    <span class="final-note">Sin tarjeta · Prueba el resultado primero</span>

    <div class="premium-note">
      <div>
        <span>Para ir más allá</span>
        <strong>Una mirada más profunda, cuando la necesites.</strong>
        <p>Premium añade deep reasoning para explorar decisiones y patrones con más detalle.</p>
      </div>
      <a href={subscriptionUrl} data-track="premium_clicked" data-track-location="final_cta">
        Descubrir premium
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta {
    min-height: 44rem;
    background: var(--indigo-deep);
    color: var(--bone);
  }

  .final-cta::before {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgb(242 238 230 / 7%), transparent 30rem);
    content: '';
  }

  .final-compass {
    position: absolute;
    top: 45%;
    left: 50%;
    width: min(34rem, 92vw);
    color: rgb(242 238 230 / 8%);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .final-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .final-cta .section-kicker {
    color: var(--ochre-on-dark);
  }

  .final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 13ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    font-weight: 530;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .final-inner > p {
    max-width: 39rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: rgb(242 238 230 / 68%);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .final-note {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: rgb(242 238 230 / 76%);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .premium-note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem 2rem;
    width: min(100%, 47rem);
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 4.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(242 238 230 / 18%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(242 238 230 / 18%);
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .premium-note div > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--ochre-on-dark);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .premium-note strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 580;
  }

  .premium-note p {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    color: rgb(242 238 230 / 74%);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .premium-note > a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-self: start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--bone);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 42rem) {
    .premium-note {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    }

    .premium-note > a {
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }
</style>
